---
// Lynik Innovations — Who We Help (concept mockup)
import './pharm-consult.css';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <title>Lynik Innovations — Who We Help (Concept)</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap"
  />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <header class="nav">
      <div class="wrap nav-row">
        <div class="wordmark-row">
          <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
          <div class="wordmark">
            <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
            <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about">About</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help" class="active">Who We Help</a>
          <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold nav-cta">Let's Talk</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="wrap hero-row">
        <div class="hero">
          <span class="eyebrow">WHO WE HELP</span>
          <h1>Medical Information Support Built Around Your Stage of Growth.</h1>
          <p class="lede2">Whether you're an emerging biotech, preparing for launch, expanding your team, or looking to improve your existing Medical Information operations, Lynik Innovations provides experienced support tailored to your needs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-media">
          <div class="photo-block"><span class="cap">Photo — consultant portrait</span></div>
          <div class="hero-caption">
            Right support.<br/>At the right time.
            <div class="rule"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="row-grid row-4">
          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21v-8M12 13c-4 0-6-2.5-6-6.5C9 7 12 8 12 13zM12 13c4 0 6-2.5 6-6.5C15 7 12 8 12 13z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Emerging Biotech and Pharma</h3>
            <p>You may be building your Medical Affairs infrastructure for the first time.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3c3.2 2.4 4.8 6 4.8 10 0 1.6-.3 2.9-.8 4H8c-.5-1.1-.8-2.4-.8-4 0-4 1.6-7.6 4.8-10z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Pre-Launch Organizations</h3>
            <p>Your product is approaching launch and MI needs to be ready.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 4h9l4 4v12H6z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h6" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Growing Pharmaceutical Companies</h3>
            <p>Your existing team needs additional capacity or specialized expertise.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Established MI Organizations</h3>
            <p>You need help with a specific project, process improvement initiative, technology implementation, or operational challenge.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-grid row-3" style="margin-top:40px;max-width:900px;margin-inline:auto">
          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 20V13M11 20V7M18 20v-9" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M4 13l7-6 7 5" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Organizations experiencing rapid growth in Medical Information demand</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="9" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="3" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M3 21c0-3.2 2.2-5 5-5s5 1.8 5 5M13 21c0-3.2 2.2-5 5-5s5 1.8 5 5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Companies seeking interim or fractional Medical Information leadership</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="var(--gold)"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Organizations looking to improve existing Medical Information operations</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">OUR APPROACH</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">Assess. Build. Optimize.</h2>
        <p class="lede">We take a strategic and practical approach to help you achieve your Medical Information goals &mdash; whether it's a single project or long-term support.</p>
        <div class="row-grid row-3" style="margin-top:44px">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">1</div>
            <span class="label">ASSESS</span>
            <h3>We start by understanding your current Medical Information capabilities, challenges, timeline, and goals.</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">2</div>
            <span class="label">BUILD</span>
            <h3>We develop the processes, resources, workflows, and operational framework needed to support your Medical Information objectives.</h3>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">3</div>
            <span class="label">OPTIMIZE</span>
            <h3>We identify opportunities to improve efficiency, quality, scalability, and overall Medical Information delivery.</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHEN YOU MIGHT NEED US</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:10px">When Your Organization Needs the Right Support.</h2>
        <p class="lede">We can help you navigate challenges, seize opportunities, and move your Medical Information function forward.</p>
        <div class="row-grid row-3" style="margin-top:44px;row-gap:36px">
          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3c3.2 2.4 4.8 6 4.8 10 0 1.6-.3 2.9-.8 4H8c-.5-1.1-.8-2.4-.8-4 0-4 1.6-7.6 4.8-10z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Preparing for a Product Launch</h3>
            <p>Your product is approaching launch and your internal Medical Information infrastructure is not fully established.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V13l5-3v11M9 21V6l5-3v18M14 21v-8l6-3v11" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Building an MI Function</h3>
            <p>You need someone who understands what a functional Medical Information operation should look like and can help build the framework.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 20V13M11 20V7M18 20v-9" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M4 13l7-6 7 5" stroke="var(--gold)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Team Is Growing Quickly</h3>
            <p>Inquiry volume, content needs, or operational complexity is increasing faster than your existing team can manage.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided first-col">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="7.5" r="3.5" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M5 21c0-4.4 3.1-7 7-7s7 2.6 7 7" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Need Interim Medical Information Leadership</h3>
            <p>You need experienced Medical Information leadership while recruiting or transitioning to a permanent team member.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 00-3.5 10.9c.6.4 1 1.1 1 1.9v.2h5v-.2c0-.8.4-1.5 1-1.9A6 6 0 0012 3z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Need Specialized Expertise</h3>
            <p>You have an internal team but need additional expertise for a specific project, launch, process improvement initiative, or operational challenge.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="item divided">
            <div class="icon-circle"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 5h4a2 2 0 100-4v4H5v4a2 2 0 100 4v4h4a2 2 0 104 0h4v-4a2 2 0 100-4v-4z" stroke="var(--forest)" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round" transform="translate(0 1) scale(0.85) translate(2 1)"/></svg></div>
            <h3>Need Additional Capacity</h3>
            <p>Your team is stretched and needs experienced support without immediately adding another full-time employee.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark">
      <div class="wrap band-cta">
        <div class="left" style="max-width:520px">
          <h2 style="font-family:'Source Serif 4',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:24px">Ready to discuss your needs?</h2>
          <p style="color:rgba(247,245,239,.78);font-size:14.5px;margin-top:8px">Let's find the right solution for your team.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="footer-top">
          <div class="wordmark-row">
            <div class="mark"><span>LKI</span></div>
            <div class="wordmark">
              <span class="name">LYNIK INNOVATIONS</span>
              <span class="tag">Life Sciences Consulting &amp; Solutions</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <nav class="footer-nav">
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/about">About</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/services">Services</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/who-we-help">Who We Help</a>
            <a href="/projects/pharm-consult/contact">Contact</a>
          </nav>
          <div class="footer-contact">
            <span>info@lynikinnovations.com</span>
            <div class="social">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="3" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="7.2" cy="7.2" r="1.1" fill="rgba(247,245,239,.7)"/><path d="M6.2 10.5v7.3M10.4 10.5v7.3M10.4 13.6c0-1.8 1.2-3.1 2.9-3.1s2.7 1.1 2.7 3.3v4" stroke="rgba(247,245,239,.7)" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <span>&copy; 2026 Lynik Innovations. All rights reserved.</span>
          <span>Madison, Wisconsin</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</body>
</html>